			(anteclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jure increpet inciletque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 963</span></i>
			: me oratione, Pac. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 125,
